---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Jose Noriega | ProActive Pixels"
  description="Jose Noriega is the founder of ProActive Pixels. He helps HIPAA-regulated nonprofits find where staff hours are going and get them back to program delivery."
  canonical="https://proactivepixels.com/about"
>
  <Nav />

  <!-- ══ FOUNDER HERO ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <div class="container ab-hero-grid">
      <div class="ab-photo-col">
        <div class="ab-photo-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/hero-jose.png"
            alt="Jose Noriega, founder of ProActive Pixels"
            class="ab-photo"
            width="480"
            height="560"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-intro-col">
        <p class="section-label">Founder</p>
        <h1 class="ab-name display">Jose Noriega</h1>
        <p class="ab-title mono">Founder, ProActive Pixels &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Orange, VA</p>
        <p class="ab-opening">
          Your staff didn't get into this work to enter data.
        </p>
        <p class="ab-opening-body">
          But that's where the hours go. Intake forms, grant reports, scheduling, case notes written after the session, manual entry across systems that don't talk to each other. The mission doesn't stop, so neither does the work, and someone on your team is absorbing all of it.
        </p>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jose-noriega-206b6a304" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ab-linkedin mono">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
          Jose Noriega on LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ STORY ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-section">
    <div class="container ab-prose-grid">
      <div class="ab-prose-label">
        <span class="section-label">Why this</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-prose-body">
        <p>
          I started ProActive Pixels because I kept seeing the same thing. Organizations with real mission, with staff who care. And those same staff spending a third of their week on tasks a system could handle.
        </p>
        <p>
          Not in theory. In practice. Intake paperwork that requires the same information to be entered in three different places. Appointment reminders done by hand because the scheduling software doesn't send them automatically. Insurance verifications called in one at a time.
        </p>
        <p>
          The people doing this work didn't sign up for it. And the organizations paying for their time didn't intend for it to go there.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ WHO WE SERVE ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-section ab-section--bordered">
    <div class="container ab-prose-grid">
      <div class="ab-prose-label">
        <span class="section-label">Who we work with</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-prose-body">
        <p>
          We work exclusively with HIPAA-regulated nonprofits. Free clinics, community health centers, behavioral health organizations, substance abuse treatment programs, mental health nonprofits, hospice and home health organizations, FQHCs.
        </p>
        <p>
          Organizations that handle PHI, have 5 to 50 paid staff, and can't just hire their way out of a capacity problem. The Executive Director is often the one absorbing the overflow. The operations lead is the one who knows exactly where the hours go and has been too busy to fix it.
        </p>
        <p>
          That's who this is for.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ THE WORK ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-section">
    <div class="container ab-prose-grid">
      <div class="ab-prose-label">
        <span class="section-label">What it looks like</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-prose-body">
        <p>
          The starting point is always a Capacity Review. Not a sales call. A structured 12-minute conversation with Alex, our intake AI, that surfaces your three biggest admin bottlenecks and tells you which ones can be addressed right now.
        </p>
        <p>
          You receive a written Operations Assessment within 24 hours. It names the bottlenecks, estimates the recoverable hours, and outlines what automating each one would take. Most organizations find 8 to 12 recoverable hours per week in the first review.
        </p>
        <p>
          If what we find can be addressed with tools your team will actually use, we help set those up. If the math doesn't work, we tell you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ HIPAA NOTE ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-section ab-section--bordered">
    <div class="container ab-prose-grid">
      <div class="ab-prose-label">
        <span class="section-label">On compliance</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-prose-body">
        <p>
          Every tool we deploy meets HIPAA standards. That's not a differentiator. For organizations that handle PHI, it's a baseline requirement — and one that a lot of vendors skip when they're moving fast.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't skip it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ CTA ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="ab-cta">
    <div class="container ab-cta-inner">
      <h2 class="ab-cta-h2 display">
        Start with a Capacity Review.
      </h2>
      <p class="ab-cta-sub">
        12 minutes with Alex. Written Operations Assessment in 24 hours. No pitch on the call.
      </p>
      <a href="/capacity-review" class="btn-pill btn-pill--lg">
        Start Your Capacity Review
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* ══ ABOUT PAGE STYLES ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ab-hero {
  padding: 120px 0 80px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.ab-hero-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr;
  gap: 64px;
  align-items: start;
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .ab-hero-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
}

/* ── PHOTO ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ab-photo-col {
  position: sticky;
  top: 100px;
}

.ab-photo-frame {
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--bg-subtle);
}

.ab-photo {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
}

@media (max-width: 860px) {
  .ab-photo-col { position: static; }
  .ab-photo-frame { max-width: 320px; }
}

/* ── INTRO COLUMN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ab-name {
  font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--fg);
  margin: 8px 0 12px;
}

.ab-title {
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  color: var(--text-faint);
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.ab-opening {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.625rem);
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--fg);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.ab-opening-body {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 520px;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.ab-linkedin {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  color: var(--green);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: opacity 0.15s;
}

.ab-linkedin:hover { opacity: 0.75; }

/* ── PROSE SECTIONS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ab-section {
  padding: var(--s-section) 0;
}

.ab-section--bordered {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--bg-subtle);
}

.ab-prose-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .ab-prose-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }
}

.ab-prose-label {
  padding-top: 4px;
}

.ab-prose-body p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.ab-prose-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

/* Give emphasis to standalone short statements */
.ab-prose-body p:only-child,
.ab-prose-body p:last-child:not(:first-child) {
  color: var(--fg);
}

/* ── CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.ab-cta {
  padding: var(--s-section) 0;
  background: var(--brand-navy, #171E62);
}

.ab-cta-inner {
  max-width: 540px;
}

.ab-cta-h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--fg-dark, oklch(97% 0.007 78));
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.ab-cta-sub {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--fg-dark-muted, oklch(97% 0.007 78 / 0.6));
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

/* Dark mode adjustments */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  .ab-section--bordered { background: var(--bg-subtle); }
}
</style>
